## 4. Supabase & native auth

Authentication (email/password + Google + Apple + password reset) is included.
See [`NATIVE_AUTH_SETUP.md`](./NATIVE_AUTH_SETUP.md) for the full provider setup.

Quick start:

1. Create a Supabase project and copy the URL + anon key into `.env`.
2. Create a `profiles` table and the optional `delete_user_account` RPC.
3. Configure Google + Apple providers (see `NATIVE_AUTH_SETUP.md`).
4. Generate exact DB types and replace `src/features/profile/types/profile.ts`:

```bash
supabase gen types typescript --project-id <ref> > src/services/supabase/database.types.ts
```
